    companion's mark is the one source for both the icon and the banner. The first group is the launcher
    foreground's own geometry (a 108 viewport) scaled 1.2, with the ring centred on 64,90. The second is
    the wordmark "Ephyra" (Android TV and Play ask for the app's name on the banner), as outlines of
    Outfit Bold (SIL OFL 1.1; see ASSETS.md) since a vector cannot use a font. Mark and word are one
    pair, centred on the tile inside the 5% safe area (16 px at the sides, 9 px top and bottom).
-->
